<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 20: </span>Qualitative comparisons of text-to-image compositional alignments: baseline (FLUX-schnell) vs. baseline + our method.</figcaption>
