<div id="A6.SS2.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present further Text-to-Video generation outcomes for rare prompts in Fig. <a href="#A6.F30" title="Figure 30 ‣ F.2.2 Text-to-Image Generation ‣ F.2 More qualitative results ‣ Appendix F Additional Experiement Results ‣ Rare Text Semantics Were Always There in Your Diffusion Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">30</span></a>-<a href="#A6.F34" title="Figure 34 ‣ F.2.2 Text-to-Image Generation ‣ F.2 More qualitative results ‣ Appendix F Additional Experiement Results ‣ Rare Text Semantics Were Always There in Your Diffusion Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>.</p>
